/*
	ModInt
	note			: The function modinv(a, P) doesn't work when a and P are not coprime.
	last verified	: 2020/09/15, AtCoder
		problem			: https://atcoder.jp/contests/abc178/tasks/abc178_d
		submission		: https://atcoder.jp/contests/abc178/submissions/16769929
